# Script example; all indices are zero-based.
section "Introduction"
paragraph 0 "Object-oriented design helps create reusable software."
section "Results"
paragraph 1 "This program is ready for testing."
format 0 0 0 15 bold on
format-title 0 0 12 size 16
checkpoint "before-results-edit"
replace-all "program" "system"
renderer markup
wrap greedy
width 50
show
stats
undo
redo
